GEOS thirdPartyLibs 9b55672f6f8a73d02fd632396eb0410e58c9b120 (TPL tag 361-1070) -- make RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION overridable

Class: build-system compatibility fix (no source/algorithm change in RAJA or GEOS).
Problem: CMakeLists.txt unconditionally forces RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION=ON for
every non-HIP build (upstream switches it OFF for ROCm because "RAJA's
vectorization layer does not compile with the ROCm toolchain"). On this node the
same layer does not compile with nvcc 13.2.78 + system GCC 14.2.1 as host
compiler: EL10's GCC defaults to -march=x86-64-v3, so __AVX2__ is defined in
every nvcc host pass and RAJA/policy/tensor/arch/avx2/avx2_int32.hpp is pulled
in; nvcc's front end rejects GCC 14's __m256i intrinsics there
('"__m256i" ... is a vector type', broadcast/self_type errors) in every CUDA
translation unit that includes RAJA/RAJA.hpp (RAJA's own exercises fail first).
Fix: only default the option when the caller has not set it, so build.sh can pass
-D RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION=OFF (exactly the switch upstream uses for ROCm).
Impact: RAJA's experimental RAJA::expt tensor/vector-register layer is not
built; GEOS and LvArray do not use it (no RAJA::expt tensor symbols in
GEOS/src or LvArray/src -- checked 2026-09-06), RAJA::forall/kernel/CUDA
policies are unaffected. Verified: TPL superbuild proceeds past RAJA with the
option OFF. Applied by level3/geos/build.sh (git apply, idempotent); the
option and the patch hash are recorded in the profile fingerprint.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -397,10 +397,14 @@
 message(STATUS "Building RAJA found at ${RAJA_URL}")
 
 # RAJA's vectorization layer does not compile with the ROCm toolchain.
-if( ENABLE_HIP )
+# (hpcperf: honour a value given on the command line, e.g. -D RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION=OFF for
+#  toolchains whose nvcc cannot compile the layer's AVX2 register code -- see level3/geos/patches/0002)
+if( NOT DEFINED RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION )
+  if( ENABLE_HIP )
     set( RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION OFF )
-else()
+  else()
     set( RAJA_ENABLE_VECTORIZATION ON )
+  endif()
 endif()
 
 ExternalProject_Add( raja
